{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "b3d5583593e044229a9f7de8cb82f821f2a0770e417eac2ad8a2ef43422bbdc0", "ja": "ふふふーん♪　ふんふんふふーん♪", "zh": "哼哼哼～♪哼哼哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c92cc16fbe29a72d444c54bc04e05273ea32a50164d1150142d7c7269aace7df", "ja": "おっ、春香、お疲れ様！", "zh": "哦，春香，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "f08d97ae9b0b53271d9ae2791c97e12564213cda3651900f8cb681438e5f3ef9", "ja": "わっ、{$P$}さん！？\nお、お疲れ様です～！", "zh": "哇，{$P$}先生！？\n你、你辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "41128835698731fe7a7a9a42f8933fd9232c32e19490cbd94e5929a4c70d96b2", "ja": "あ、あの～、私のヘンな鼻歌、\n聞こえちゃいました？", "zh": "那、那个～\n你听见我在哼怪歌了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1004_p", "source_sha256": "767d529c522955740aa9ae3f94eeda6dac59fdd78faddae2c58e633d5373226e", "ja": "ははは、かわいい鼻歌なら聞こえたけどな。\nところで、いい香りがするけど、何か作ってるのか？", "zh": "哈哈哈，我只听到有人哼了一段可爱的歌而已。\n话说好像有股香味，你在做什么料理吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "79aed43d21d52a5d46625b7a5cab17f3834b75284ef7eddb89c2222397b999b8", "ja": "えへへ……給湯室のオーブントースターでもできる、\n簡単なクッキーを作ってるんですよ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……我正在做即使用茶水间的烤箱\n也能完成的简单小饼干啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "1415b0786fa6cca88d336b73c66c465b211ac9386302afcccffa6e0f5dc3f453", "ja": "前に作ったマカロンが、劇場のみんなにも大好評で、\n色んな子にお菓子作りを習いたいって言われたんです。", "zh": "我之前做的马卡龙，在剧场的伙伴之间也大受好评，\n很多人都说想跟我学做点心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "ce71fd4379f89071f2a2f9436d06b951e59953031019a87dd3aa9556e40c7d94", "ja": "マカロンは難しいから、まずはクッキーを、\nここで作れちゃったりしないかなって思って……。", "zh": "因为马卡龙不好做，\n所以我打算先试试能不能在这边做饼干……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0009f417b446f3142e9cf47e406b67f7157167c866a3636a605cd18e03ab9c2d", "ja": "それはすごいな！\nで、どうだ？　完成しそうかな？", "zh": "真厉害！\n结果如何？做得出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "eb3509d77479573fb71b6f6a671de51496e2ac9264992210022407f1182823af", "ja": "失敗するかなって思ってたんですけど、上手くいき\nそうです！　焼きあがったら試食してもらえますか？", "zh": "本来以为可能会失败，但现在看来应该能顺利完成！\n烤好以后可以麻烦你试吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a9959946db513a8095e965caa59c142ead53c5e1bf98f479a588afedefc33eb2", "ja": "もちろん。でも、この劇場でクッキーが\n作れるなんて思ってもみなかったよ。", "zh": "那当然。但我还真没想到，\n在这间剧场居然有办法做饼干。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "90d159d8f59cdb89cb3de44a8b5c5689a2bf6179c04fe40b17f4149878e8dc93", "ja": "えへへっ、この調子だと、\n他のお菓子も作れるかも……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，照这个样子看来，\n说不定也能做出其他点心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0042_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "5e80968a46a46dfd662c10eac846e6ce184cab363e1ad3d17363181119c7c7c5", "ja": "上手にできたら持っていきますから、楽しみにしてて\nくださいねっ、{$P$}さんっ♪", "zh": "要是顺利完成，我会送去给你的。\n请你好好期待喔，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
